{"seconds": 230.8, "exit": 0, "final": "Black is winning with a rook advantage. The key move is **Qe6+**, which forks the king and rook, forcing White into a losing position.\n\n**Coaching note:**\nYour queen on e6 gives check while attacking the undefended rook on h3\u2014a royal fork! White cannot defend both the king and the rook. If the king moves, you capture the rook with Qxh3. If White tries Re3 or blocks with Qe4, you still win major material. Always scan for checks that simultaneously attack your opponent's valuable pieces, especially undefended ones.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qe6+\", \"line\": [\"Qe6+\", \"Kf2\", \"Qxh3\", \"Qc7\", \"Kg6\", \"Qxd6\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "f6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "f4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "h3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "e1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "c2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "h3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "move": "Qc3+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "mo